WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.818
Welcome to Orbit. The people who matter. Our focus is Defining and non-defining clauses.

2
00:00:07.818 --> 00:00:17.711
Use commas for extra information in non-defining clauses. Do not use that after a comma. Use whose to show possession.

3
00:00:17.711 --> 00:00:22.570
My mentor, who runs a studio, is very supportive.

4
00:00:22.570 --> 00:00:25.789
The project that we finished won an award.

5
00:00:25.789 --> 00:00:29.124
This is the office where we meet every Friday.

6
00:00:29.124 --> 00:00:38.522
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
